* Technical concepts\nbehind the 2021 hacks
** Privileged calls
*** Selector collision, confused deputy (Poly Network)
*** Delegatecall into an allowlisted proxy (Furucombo)
*** Unprotected initialize (Punk, DAO Maker, DODO)
** Prices and shares
*** Vault share price inflated by donation (Cream)
*** Spot reserves in reward minting (PancakeBunny)
*** Live balances in share math (Spartan, Indexed)
** Arithmetic and accounting
*** Constant mismatch in the K check (Uranium)
*** Index not initialised (Compound Proposal 062)
*** Rounding at tiny supply (Alpha Homora)
*** Same token in and out (MonoX)
*** Shares transferred without checkpoint (Popsicle)
** Reentrancy through tokens
*** ERC-777 hooks (Cream / AMP)
*** Caller-chosen token (Grim, BurgerSwap)
** Off-chain and keys
*** Front-end injection (BadgerDAO)
*** Observer trusting events (THORChain)
*** ECDSA nonce reuse (Anyswap)
@endmindmap
